          <view class="review-explanation"><view class="review-explanation-heading"><image src="{{icons.returnDocument}}" mode="aspectFit" aria-hidden="true" /><text class="settlement-section-title">说明</text></view><text class="review-copy review-section-copy">官方正在核实费用依据，处理结果将在本单更新。实收后不继续累计逾期。</text></view>
        </view>
        <view wx:else class="settlement-card {{returnReviewPage.complete ? 'review-highlight' : ''}}">
